hey guys get straight out here earlier  this month I celebrated my mother's  birthday by paying her a surprise visit  to the town where she works in we live  in separate towns and throughout the  five six years of not being in the  country  I've always sent gifts cakes and cuts  from abroad and so I thought I would do  something different this year instead of  just buying her another cake I decided  to bake my first ever carrot cake and  surprise her her shocked reaction and  pure joy reminded me one of the main  reasons why I decided to come back which  is to be closer to my family and friends  I have to be honest I was really nervous  that the cake would be a disaster but it  turns out to be super yummy and  everybody loved it and of course this  carrot cake was a healthier version with  no butter no artificial sugar it is low  in calories and low in fat  most carrot cake so that I've tried tend  to be overly sweet and it is very high  in calories this carrot cake however is  very moist naturally sweetened crunchy  and it is actually good for you  so my mom and a friend could enjoy the  cable without feeling guilty and so I  posted our special moment on Facebook  and Instagram you guys requested for the  recipe  here it is  next Sunday is Mother's Day so bake this  cake for your mother and surprise her or  they give really loved ones a cake made  by you with love will always taste  yummier compared to store-bought cakes  so let's start with the cake the  ingredients you need are 1 cup of whole  wheat or white flour or a mixture of  both I use half and half 2.5 teaspoons  of baking powder 1 teaspoon of cinnamon  all mixed spices 2 X 4 taken you may  want meat this 1/2 a cup of honey or  maple syrup cut a cup of extra virgin  olive oil 1/2 a cup of applesauce  unsweetened one teaspoon of vanilla  extract one and a half cups of carrots  peeled and grated and 1/2 a cup of  ground cashew nuts  preheat the oven to 180 degrees Celsius  or 350 degrees Fahrenheit in a bowl  combine the dry ingredients flour baking  powder and mix spices set aside in a  large bowl beat the eggs on high speed  for about 1 minute until foamy add in  the honey and beat on high speed for  another 3 to 4 minutes until well  combined then stir in the olive oil  apple sauce and vanilla extract until  thoroughly combined next add in half of  the flour mixture and stir it until just  combined then add in the remaining flour  mixture stir well finally fill in the  grated carrots and cashew nuts  Greece is a heart-shaped team or an  inch-thick team with a little bit of  olive oil pour the batter into the cake  team and spread out evenly place into  the oven and bake for 30 to 35 minutes  until a toothpick inserted into the  center comes out clean while waiting for  the cake to bake in the oven let's go  ahead and make the light and healthy  cream-cheese frosting  only three main ingredients three ounces  of cream cheese quarter cup of plain  yogurt and half a teaspoon of vanilla  extract you can also add 2 tablespoons  of stevia for extra sweetness this is  optional in a pan or ball B the cream  cheese and too soft for about one minute  add in the yogurt and vanilla extract  continue to be for two to three minutes  and to smooth and well combined finally  stir in the stevia children cream cheese  frosting in the fridge until ready to  use once the cake is done remove from  the oven and allow it to cool completely  to room temperature before assembling  and frosting your cake if your cake is  still warm your frosting will melt so  cover the entire cake generously with  frosting this step can be tedious so  really take your time and just enjoy the  process and because we're using yogurt  this light and healthy frosting will be  thinner than your typical butter and  sugar load of frosting don't worry about  it  the frosting will thicken once chilled  once the entire cake is covered with  frosting it is time to decorate the cake  how you like it  my mom loves the crunchy texture of nuts  especially cashew nuts  so I'll top my cake with 1/3 cup of  ground cashew nut  and decorate with sliced strawberries  around the heart topped with few  blueberries presenting cake how you know  your mum or your loved ones would like  it so try different toppings  this cake is best eaten on the same day  but chill in the fridge it is not in  turn right away it will last three to  four days in the fridge  this skinny and healthy carrot cake is  very moist with other crunchiness for  the nuts  it is sweetened with natural goodness  from the honey and apple sauce and you  can actually taste and bite into the  carrots one serving of cake with a cream  cheese frosting only has about 200  calories which is less than the  traditional singulair recipe which has  about 300 calories and because these are  all natural ingredients which are good  for you  you and your loved ones can enjoy the  cake without feeling guilty so be sure  to try my skinny healthy carrot cake  recipe and bake it for your loved ones  you can even turn this into Chum mini  cup muffins and have them for breakfast  or snacks  try it and share your creation with me  on Facebook and Instagram all the best  for new Fitness food and motivational  videos please like share and subscribe  to my You Tube channel and website do  you follow me on Facebook Instagram and  Twitter to stay connected with me thanks  guys  you  you
 

